  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nWarm, welcoming, and bathed in all-day sun, this sophisticated 1920s transitional villa offers effortless Devonport living — perfect for small families or downsizers who don't want to compromise on style.\r\n\r\nFully and beautifully renovated while lovingly retaining its original character, this light-filled home features polished native timber floors, high ceilings, fireplaces, and elegant period detailing throughout.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautiful light-filled designer kitchen with views, flowing seamlessly into the open-plan family and dining areas. Double-glazed doors open to a sun-filled, northeast-facing deck with stunning sunrises and views of Mt Victoria — the perfect spot for morning coffee and relaxed entertaining.\r\n\r\nVersatile by design, the home currently offers two generous, sun-filled bedrooms at the front, with an easy third option. The open lounge could easily be closed off to create a third bedroom — ideal for a growing family, guests, or that highly sought-after work-from-home flexibility. A very spacious modern bathroom and laundry complete the interior.\r\n\r\nOutside is a true gardener's delight. The wonderful established gardens enjoy absolute all-day sun and feature raised veggie patches, a prolific assortment of established fruit trees, beautiful flower beds, and a handy gardener's shed — a private and productive oasis. There is also plenty of space for a swimming pool, plus room for a garage to the side for extra storage. The attractive, well-designed front garden provides off-street parking for two vehicles.\r\n\r\nWe highly encourage you to view this fabulous, sophisticated, classic and sunny home. Perfectly positioned within easy walking distance to the village, ferry, beaches, and top schools in a friendly, safe neighbourhood — what more could you ask for!",
